  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/fancy-entity-renderer/banner.png\" alt=\"Баннер Fancy Entity Renderer\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=26.1&amp;g=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-1.svg\" alt=\"1.20.1\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"Loader\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/forge.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client.svg\" alt=\"Overlay\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"Issues\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2>📝 <strong>Описание</strong></h2><p>Fancy Entity Renderer — это мод-API, позволяющий легко отображать сущности на любом экране, меню, GUI или HUD!</p><p><strong>Официально используется модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FancyMenu</a></strong>:</p><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JhglQuxb6OE?si=sQFgio12yWp651vk\" width=\"100%\" height=\"512px\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><h2>🔗 <strong>Зависимости</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Мод</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Загрузчик</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Требование</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Назначение</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Все</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Необязательно <code>1.21+</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Настроить цвет наложения огня</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Все</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Необязательно <code>1.20.1</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Настроить цвет наложения огня</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>📜 <strong>Лицензия и права на использование</strong></h2><p>Смело используйте этот мод в любых модах, модпаках или видео, только не забудьте указать авторство и, возможно, добавить ссылку <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">сюда</a>.<br>\nЭтот проект опубликован под <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лицензией сообщества Crystal Nest v1</a>.</p><h2>❤️ <strong>Поддержите нас</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Сайт Crystal Nest\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Наши другие проекты\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
